+ * Board connections:
+ * SSI_GPIO_CS: GPIO21 (active low)
+ * input "dc": GPIO4; input "reset": GPIO5 (active low)
+ * output "busy": GPIO6 (active low)
+ * input "sclk": GPIO8; input "mosi": GPIO10
+ * output "sda": GPIO10 input, for the half-duplex bit-banged VER probe.
